        },
        "quote": "It shall be unlawful for any industrial user to be in significant noncompliance with the pretreatment requirements set forth in this article. An industrial user is in significant noncompliance if its violation meets one or more of the following criteria:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.540 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "829a4e78-2af9-5ced-acdd-f9c5b71037b3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 439,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:1",
          "start": 255
        },
        "quote": "(a) Chronic Violations. Sixty-six percent or more of the measurements exceed the same daily maximum limit or the same average limit in a six-month period (any magnitude of exceedance).",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.540 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "b9bbf2c4-42d8-54ed-b8b1-fb5f16c6c211",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 645,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:2",
          "start": 440
        },
        "quote": "(b) Technical Review Criteria or “TRC” Violations. Thirty-three percent or more of the measurements exceed the same daily maximum limit or the same average limit by more than the TRC in a six-month period.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.540 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "52c9275e-1d08-5c7f-9909-59c3b3b90072",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 829,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:3",
          "start": 646
        },
        "quote": "There are two groups of TRCs: BOD, TSS, fats, oil, and grease, where the TRC is 1.4; and group II for all other pollutants, where the TRC is 1.2 except pH. No TRC will be used for pH.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.540 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "721c5883-d211-5aa6-9b5f-33ce80652a79",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1106,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:4",
          "start": 830
        },
        "quote": "(c) Any other violation of an effluent limit (average or daily maximum) that the City believes has caused, alone or in combination with other discharges, interference (e.g., slug loads) or pass-through; or endangered the health of the sewage treatment personnel or the public.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.540 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "e441a0c9-6896-5430-8657-559c64a4756b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1349,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:5",
          "start": 1107
        },
        "quote": "(d) Any discharge of a pollutant that has caused imminent endangerment to human health/welfare or to the environment and has resulted in the POTW’s exercise of its emergency authority, as found in the ERP, to halt or prevent such a discharge.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.540 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "0d917099-7f32-5479-8b88-078219e9a3cd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1587,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:6",
          "start": 1350
        },
        "quote": "(e) Violations of compliance schedule milestones, contained in a local control mechanism or enforcement order, for starting construction, completing construction, and attaining final compliance by 90 days or more after the schedule date.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.540 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "fe5f606e-9cb5-56fe-9fc7-3f9bcc8c6f27",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1804,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:7",
          "start": 1588
        },
        "quote": "(f) Failure to provide reports for compliance schedules, self-monitoring data, or categorical standards (baseline monitoring reports, 90-day compliance reports, and periodic reports) within 30 days from the due date.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.540 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "41ed074f-8a07-5e08-924b-c45659d59f5d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1852,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:8",
          "start": 1805
        },
        "quote": "(g) Failure to accurately report noncompliance.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.540 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "b2a50be6-41d9-578b-a855-659eb34fbf53",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1985,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.540:block:9",
          "start": 1853
